---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PrivacyPolicy from "../components/additional/PrivacyPolicy.astro";
import { getTranslations } from "../i18n/utils";

const translations = await getTranslations("en");
---

<Layout title={translations.meta.privacy.title} description={translations.meta.privacy.description} locale="en">
  <PrivacyPolicy translations={translations} />
</Layout>

<style>
  [data-custom-class="body"],
  [data-custom-class="body"] * {
    background: transparent !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="title"],
  [data-custom-class="title"] * {
    font-family: Arial !important;
    font-size: 26px !important;
    color: #000000 !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="subtitle"],
  [data-custom-class="subtitle"] * {
    font-family: Arial !important;
    color: #595959 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="heading_1"],
  [data-custom-class="heading_1"] * {
    font-family: Arial !important;
    font-size: 19px !important;
    color: #000000 !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="heading_2"],
  [data-custom-class="heading_2"] * {
    font-family: Arial !important;
    font-size: 17px !important;
    color: #000000 !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="body_text"],
  [data-custom-class="body_text"] * {
    color: #595959 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    font-family: Arial !important;
  }
  [data-custom-class="link"],
  [data-custom-class="link"] * {
    color: #3030f1 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    font-family: Arial !important;
    word-break: break-word !important;
  }
</style>
<div data-custom-class="body">
  <div>
    <strong
      ><span style="font-size: 26px;"
        ><span data-custom-class="title"
          >PRIVACY POLICY</span
        ></span
      ></strong
    >
  </div>
  <div><br /></div>
  <div>
    <span style="color: rgb(127, 127, 127);"
      ><strong
        ><span style="font-size: 15px;"
          ><span data-custom-class="subtitle"
            >Last updated August 29, 2025</span
          ></span
        ></strong
      ></span
    >
  </div>
  <div><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span data-custom-class="heading_1"><strong>Introduction</strong></span>
  </div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        This privacy notice for <strong>osvauld security solutions private limited</strong> ("<strong>we</strong>," "<strong>us</strong>," or "<strong>our</strong>") describes how and why we might process your information, reflecting our strong commitment to privacy and our open-source roots.
    </span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        This policy is divided into two parts:
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Our Website (`osvauld.com`)</strong>: This section applies to users of our website.</li>
            <li><strong>Our Software (The Osvauld Application)</strong>: This section applies to users of our decentralized, on-premise desktop software.</li>
        </ol>
    </span>
     <br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        <strong>Questions or concerns?</strong> Reading this privacy notice will help you understand your privacy rights. If you do not agree with our policies, please do not use our website or software. If you have any questions, please contact us at <strong>osvauld@gmail.com</strong>.
     </span>
  </div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
     <span data-custom-class="heading_1"><strong>Part 1: Privacy Policy for Our Website (osvauld.com)</strong></span>
  </div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        This section describes the very limited information we process when you visit our website at `https://osvauld.com` or contact us directly.
     </span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>What Information Do We Collect?</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Server Log Information</strong>: When you visit our website, our web server may automatically log standard technical information. This includes your IP address (which can indicate your approximate geographical location), the pages you visited on our site, and the date and time of your visit. We also count the number of times the software is downloaded. This information is not used to identify you personally.</li>
            <li><strong>Information You Voluntarily Provide</strong>: We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you contact us via email, such as your name and email address.</li>
        </ul>
     </span>
     <br />
      <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>How Do We Use Your Website Information?</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       We use the minimal server log data solely for our own internal purposes: to understand which countries our visitors are from and to count the total number of software downloads. This helps us ensure our website is functioning correctly. We do not use this data to track individual users or for advertising.
     </span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>No Cookies or Third-Party Analytics</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       We respect your privacy. Our website <strong>does not</strong> use cookies for tracking or advertising. We <strong>do not</strong> use any third-party analytics services (like Google Analytics). All usage statistics are generated from our own server logs.
     </span>
  </div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
     <span data-custom-class="heading_1"><strong>Part 2: Privacy Policy for the Osvauld Software</strong></span>
  </div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        This section applies to your use of our downloadable desktop software application (the "Software").
    </span>
    <br /><br />
    <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Zero-Knowledge and No Data Collection Guarantee</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       <ul>
        <li>The Software is designed to be <strong>zero-knowledge</strong>. This means we, the creators of Osvauld, have <strong>no ability to access, view, or decrypt</strong> the credentials, secrets, or any other data you store within the Software ("User Data").</li>
        <li>Your User Data is stored locally on your device or on infrastructure you control. It is <strong>never</strong> sent to our servers.</li>
        <li>The Software <strong>does not collect or transmit any personal information, telemetry, or usage analytics</strong> back to us. We do not know who you are, how you use the software, or what you store in it.</li>
       </ul>
     </span>
     <br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Your Data, Your Responsibility</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        Since we do not have access to your User Data, we <strong>cannot</strong> help you recover a forgotten master password or restore lost data. You are solely responsible for the security and backup of your own data.
     </span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Updates to the Software</strong></span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
        The Software may periodically check for new versions, which may involve a connection to our servers. This process does not transmit any personal information.
     </span>
   </div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
   <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
     <span data-custom-class="heading_1"><strong>General Provisions (Applies to both Site and Software)</strong></span>
  </div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;"><br /></div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.5;">
    <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Do We Share Information?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       <ul>
        <li>We <strong>do not</strong> sell, rent, or share any personal information collected from our Website with any third party for any reason.</li>
        <li>As we collect <strong>no personal information</strong> from the <strong>Software</strong>, there is nothing for us to share.</li>
       </ul>
     </span>
     <br />
    <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>How Long Do We Keep Your Information?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       We only keep the personal information collected from your <strong>Website</strong> visit (e.g., from an email inquiry) for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this notice, unless a longer period is required by law. Server logs are anonymized and may be kept for analytical purposes.
     </span>
     <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Do We Collect Information from Minors?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       We do not knowingly solicit data from or market to children under 18 years of age through our Site or Software.
     </span>
      <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>What Are Your Privacy Rights?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
      <ul>
        <li>Regarding our <strong>Website</strong>, you may have rights under applicable law to request access to, or deletion of, the personal information we have collected from you (e.g., your email from an inquiry). To make such a request, please contact us.</li>
        <li>Regarding the <strong>Software</strong>, since we hold none of your personal User Data, these rights are exercised by you directly. You can review, update, or delete your data at any time from within your own installation of the Software.</li>
      </ul>
     </span>
     <br />
     <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>Do We Make Updates to This Notice?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       Yes, we will update this notice as necessary to stay compliant with relevant laws. The updated version will be indicated by a revised date.
     </span>
      <br /><br />
      <span data-custom-class="heading_2"><strong>How Can You Contact Us?</strong></span>
    <br /><br />
     <span data-custom-class="body_text">
       If you have questions or comments about this notice, you may email us at <strong>osvauld@gmail.com</strong> or contact us by post at:
       <br /><br />
       <strong>osvauld security solutions private limited</strong><br />
        Cheruthoni<br />
        Idukki, Kerala 685602<br />
        India
     </span>
  </div>
</div>